      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "11282C69A2850575",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在生態巨蛋\\n捉到了……[VAR 0x0202(0001)]種寶可夢！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
