      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "11282769A284FCF6",
      "text": "咦～？果然沒錯！\\n所有種類都齊了～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "11283269A2850FA7",
      "text": "藍莓圖鑑完成了！\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳果然了不起～！可喜可賀～！[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "11283169A2850DF4",
      "text": "託[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的福，\\n棲息在巨蛋裡的所有寶可夢的資料，\\r\\n應該都收集到了吧？[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
