    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_20",
      "hash64": "11213E69A27F055D",
      "text": "這裡可以說是\\n欣賞夕陽的頭等席吧。\\c\\n就算只為了這個，在大海的\\n正中央蓋學園也值得了啊～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
