      "label": "s2_sub_010_headbb_25",
      "hash64": "11213969A27EFCDE",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，晚安。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳淋著雨還是那麼努力呢～\\c\\n小心不要腳一滑，\\n就從棧橋掉進海裡去了喔～[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
